          "book": "1KI",
          "chapter": 19,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "After the earthquake a fire passed; but the LORD was not in the fire. After the fire, there was a still small voice.",
      "ko": "또 지진 후에 불이 있으나 불 가운데도 여호와께서 계시지 아니하더니 불 후에 세미한 소리가 있는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "84bebd374b43b8dc5f588d9a0ae079abf58e6255f967c05e6a7bb31c798591b4",
      "translation_text_hash": "bef4497af79a82a2d468fb63235aaa4115ef734e2cda6df9abe1be3558fc2754",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
